  "description": "NAJMAQ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C56 H58 N8 O36 Si8 Tb4 2-,2(C8 H20 N1 1+),3(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 8 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.700-3.749 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 105.60-107.53°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (Et4N)2[(PhSiO1.5)8(TbO1.5)4(O)(NO2.5)6(EtOH)2(MeCN)2]·MeCN.",
